1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:39,370
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 15=

3
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:24,780
Why are you up so early?

4
00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:26,680
I stayed up all night.

5
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:28,020
Why?

6
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,000
I'm afraid you'd run away.

7
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,400
Silly.

8
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:37,000
This is my home.

9
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Where would I go?

10
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:43,060
Wen Wanqing.

11
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:46,060
What are we now?

12
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,240
What do you think?

13
00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:55,140
I think

14
00:01:55,780 --> 00:01:57,020
we're together now.

15
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:01,040
But what if I've got it wrong?

16
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,900
How do you want me to prove it?

17
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:04,520
Say it yourself.

18
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:05,920
Then I'll believe it.

19
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,320
We're together.

20
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,840
Did you hear that?

21
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:20,900
I did.

22
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,200
But could you say it again?

23
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,640
I want to record it.

24
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,000
Pei Yiqiu.

25
00:02:27,580 --> 00:02:28,980
Don't push your luck.

26
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:32,920
Okay.

27
00:02:33,780 --> 00:02:34,820
You've said it now.

28
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,400
There's no escaping me.

29
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,400
Wen Wanqing.

30
00:02:47,820 --> 00:02:48,520
Wen Wanqing.

31
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,720
I'm here.

32
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:51,520
Wen Wanqing!

33
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:52,840
I'm here, I'm here.

34
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,520
Pei Yiqiu.

35
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,780
I'm here.

36
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,880
Coming!

37
00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:16,940
Wanqing.

38
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:18,480
I have something to tell you.

39
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:22,640
So do I, actually.

40
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,960
Get me some water first.

41
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:25,120
I'm parched.

42
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,640
You go first.

43
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:49,780
No, you go.

44
00:03:49,780 --> 00:03:50,600
Look at you.

45
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:51,880
I know you can't hold it in.

46
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,320
Well,

47
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,920
Gu Yuan and I

48
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:02,500
made up.

49
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,280
You're not surprised?

50
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:07,080
I told you you'd make up.

51
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:11,240
So,

52
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,620
what did you want to tell me?

53
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,660
I...

54
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,040
What?

55
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,580
Tell me.

56
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:23,820
Sis.

57
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,020
Morning.

58
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,080
The two of us

59
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:48,760
are together now.

60
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,360
You. Outside.

61
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,020
We need to talk.

62
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,080
Mu...

63
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:03,620
It's okay. Don't worry.

64
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:15,920
You've got some nerve,

65
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,000
going after my best friend.

66
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,340
She's my best friend, you know.

67
00:05:18,340 --> 00:05:18,680
Sis.

68
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,400
How could you...

69
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,440
Remember

70
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,000
when you were applying to college,

71
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,160
Mom and Dad had a huge fight?

72
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:31,640
She's a girl.

73
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:32,760
Why study design?

74
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,280
What's the point?

75
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:35,440
She wants to study design.

76
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,560
Then let her study it.

77
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:38,100
It's her dream.

78
00:05:38,300 --> 00:05:39,660
Will dreams pay the bills?

79
00:05:40,340 --> 00:05:41,360
Why not take the exam

80
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,700
for a secure civil service job?

81
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,040
You're setting her up for failure.

82
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,280
You think that's best for her?

83
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:49,040
Have you asked her
what she really wants?

84
00:05:49,500 --> 00:05:51,000
She's my daughter.

85
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:52,480
Do you think I'd hurt her?

86
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:54,200
She's too young

87
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:55,260
to know any better.

88
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,280
By the time she does, it'll be too late.

89
00:05:57,380 --> 00:05:58,660
Stay out of my business!

90
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,680
I make my own choices.

91
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:01,640
See?

92
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,480
You've spoiled her.

93
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,080
Stick to raising your own son.

94
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:07,160
Leave my daughter alone.

95
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,840
Don't you talk to Mom like that!

96
00:06:09,740 --> 00:06:10,060
Mom.

97
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:10,780
Let's go.

98
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,460
So you outrank me now?

99
00:06:13,540 --> 00:06:14,160
Stop!

100
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:15,820
Get back here!

101
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,840
They're fighting over my sister.

102
00:06:25,180 --> 00:06:26,200
I feel like

103
00:06:26,500 --> 00:06:28,860
I don't belong in this new family.

104
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,840
Mom and Dad divorced,

105
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,600
and I don't have a dad anymore.

106
00:06:34,180 --> 00:06:35,240
Now,

107
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,280
Mom's married to Uncle Su,

108
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:42,180
and she's my sister's mom instead.

109
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:49,840
Come on.

110
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,540
I'll take you somewhere.

111
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:55,540
Let's go.

112
00:07:20,610 --> 00:07:22,470
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
